{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "711c81d6-2998-8a0e-ac03-7b63adf627c6",
  "created_at": "2026-01-09T11:43:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:41:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. This is Moira Hanlon. Let me explain what's going on. There's a manhole cover in front of 74 Kay Street that has sunk down in the road, and every single time a car crosses it, it rings. Bang, clang, all day long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a nuisance. How long has it been doing that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since before Thanksgiving. I called in December, and somebody put a cone out for about a day. Then the cone was gone and the cover is still sunk. Now they're saying this coastal storm is hitting today, and with the rain and the plows it's only going to get worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it down in a dip, like the road has settled around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the cover sits a couple of inches below the pavement. I have photos, if there's somewhere to send them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can give you an email for those after I log this. Let me put in the location, 74 Kay Street, sunken manhole cover, noisy with traffic. I'll mark it for a crew to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could I get a reference number, please? So I'm not starting over again the next time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Hang on one second. [pause] Okay, I've got it in the system. I'll read that number to you now, so grab a pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:43:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead. By the way, my nephew works in your building, so if this goes nowhere I can always walk it up to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:43:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, let's hope it doesn't come to that. Crews will be stretched thin with the storm, but it's logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you, Denise."
    }
  ],
